1	// Teaser page (teaser.html): the teaser stops as scroll stories. Scrolled to, a car's stage (museum photo / 3-D model)
2	// pins, above the steps on a phone held upright and beside them otherwise, and only the steps move on: the introduction
3	// over the museum photo, one step per component with its cards (controls, legend, technical facts) in 3D, then background
4	// back on the photo with the car outline. The step at the reading line sets what the stage shows; only stages on screen
5	// run their frame loop. Each story links its stop page with &r=teaser, so the stop pages page between these stops.
6	import tour, { teaser } from "../../stops/tour.js";
7	import { showOfflineStatus } from "./offline.js";
